# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Machine Learning Models
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Models are ~10 MB each. They ARE tracked normally since each
# is under GitHub's 100 MB hard limit.
# If GitHub LFS is preferred, uncomment the lines below and run:
#   git lfs install
#   git lfs track "backend/models/*.h5"
# backend/models/*.h5

# Ignore other heavy/binary model formats
backend/models/*.pb
backend/models/*.tflite
backend/models/variables/

